From 95986100b3bc4ad1f909da3a4d7861f94673e6d8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SableOS <noreply@sableos.invalid>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 21:53:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1063/1063] SableOS: FM recording through the bridge, and the playing
 notification on the lock screen

The bridge gets MSG_RECORD_START and MSG_RECORD_STOP and reports whether a
recording is running, how long it has run and the last saved name. A
recording the bridge started is saved as soon as the recorder goes idle,
under Recordings/FM recordings so Sable Media finds it in MediaStore. The
playing notification and its channel are public on the lock screen.
---
 src/com/android/fmradio/FmRecorder.java       |  6 +--
 src/com/android/fmradio/FmService.java        |  4 ++
 .../android/fmradio/SableFmBridgeService.java | 52 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../fmradio/sable/SableFmProtocol.java        | 12 ++++-
 4 files changed, 70 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

